# 📄 Document Comparator AI (Professional Analyzer)

A powerful Python-based desktop application that intelligently compares two documents (PDF or Word) and highlights differences while evaluating which document is more professional.

---

## 🚀 Features

✔️ Compare two documents (PDF / DOCX / DOC)  
✔️ Detect:
- Added content (+)
- Removed content (-)
- Common content  

✔️ Dual Viewing Modes:
- Simple Mode (easy & user-friendly)
- Technical Mode (detailed diff view)

✔️ Professionalism Analyzer:
- Score documents out of 100
- Evaluates:
  - Document structure (Education, Skills, Experience)
  - Use of professional keywords
  - Sentence quality
  - Presence of contact information

✔️ Export Functionality:
- Download comparison results as `.txt`

✔️ Modern GUI:
- Clean, responsive, and user-friendly interface built with Tkinter

---

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- Python 🐍  
- Tkinter (GUI Development)  
- pdfminer.six (PDF text extraction)  
- python-docx (Word document processing)  
- difflib (Text comparison engine)  
- Regular Expressions (Text cleaning & analysis)  

---

## 📦 Installation

```bash
pip install pdfminer.six python-docx
```
